ants. Also, the payment method for refunds must be valid.\n\nI'll start by finding the user ID via email. Then, get user details to access the default address and payment methods. Then, handle each request step by step, confirming each action with the user.\n</think>\n\n<tool_call>\n{\"name\": \"find_user_id_by_email\", \"arguments\": {\"email\": \"lucas.brown9344@example.com\"}}\n",
